Z||000005||danny boy||06-02-2001||09:20 PM||||Hi.  I'm Issa, Danny Boys woman.  (I can't spell pheonsay the correct way, so I'll just be his "woman" on here) Anyway...it's too bad that your wife & stepdaughters are afraid of your brother.  I was timid around Jim at first, but he trusts me and that makes a world of difference.  Trust is one of those things that doesn't have a thing to do with your mental state.  I'm no expert on anything, and I know that trust doesn't fix the scarey part of it all.  I think that I am just all excited that Jim & I have a bond.  Hope your brother gets to see more better days.  Good luck to you all!||||reg||1
